Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Separate audited ended-run retain refusals from
 replica drift

A definitively rejected retain intent cannot be applied retention. Keep outbox and immutable custody unchanged while allowing converged replicas to be clean only when exact frozen request identity/digest and both closed original runs prove the rejection. Missing or conflicting custody and any ordinary row drift remain fail closed. RED: 15 passed, integration clean assertion failed on base. GREEN: sync and retain suites plus full scripts/check.
